<title>USA: Compaq's Tandem buy seen problem-free -arbs.</title>
<headline>Compaq's Tandem buy seen problem-free -arbs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compaq Computer Corp's friendly stock swap takeover of Tandem Computers Inc should close by the fall with few or no complications, arbitrageurs and traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;It is a straightforward deal between two companies that know each other very well. It is relatively issueless, though there is some question about whether or not it will hamper Compaq's growth rate,&quot; said an arb who requested anonymity.</p>
<p>Compaq said it will acquire Tandem by swapping stock at a ratio of 0.21 of a share for each Tandem share.</p>
</text>
